};
cli.calls = base.calls;
``
But pushing into base.calls AND base(args) pushing again → double record. Make the branch check return '' before delegating — no double push for that command; other commands: pushed by my wrapper AND by base → double. Use a standalone fn (cleaner):

```js
var calls = [];
